# Session start

1. Identify the active app / package from the user request
2. Read root `AGENTS.md` (index only)
3. Open `DESIGN.md` (or equivalent) **relevant sections** + the code you will change
4. If `chat-context/CURRENT.md` exists, read it. Do **not** read all archive logs

Procedures: skill `start-project`. Long standards live in project docs — open only the section you need.
